WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.140
"St. Paul's Cathedral."

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:08.170
"I'll be there, beginning preparations 
for my rebellion against God."

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:12.130
"Come and walk toward a new future with me."

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.320
"All is for the sake of this plan..."

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.060
"...Code: Realize."

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.310
It has begun...

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:28.690
If this plan is not stopped, then in order
 to meet its correct fate, this world will...

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:35.020
Now, let us commence the 
creation of our new world.

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:38.070
Watch me, Father.

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:21.740
The Flames of War

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.230
Van! Count!

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:26.110
We couldn't find her.

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:28.820
Damn it! Where'd she go?

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:31.210
It's been three days since she took off!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:33.370
You think she really went to Wales?

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:36.560
Maybe Lupin's found her by now.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:41.510
Even if he has, there's no telling 
if they'll come back.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:46.780
Still...

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:51.010
Still, Cardia is my angel!

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:52.290
Impey...

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.520
I want her to come back!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.440
Don't you guys feel the same?!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.310
Of course.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.540
Right, Van?

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.740
Let's try searching again.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:06.530
I'll try the upper city.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.030
Impey, let me see the map.

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.100
Got it.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.420
What happened?!

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:29.740
Saint!

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:34.050
We don't need to worry about him.

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:37.390
But it looks like we'd best 
get away from here.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:53.090
Secure a place for evacuation!

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.780
I want a report on these explosions.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.660
Your Majesty.

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:02.800
Explosions have occurred at London Bridge, 
Central Station, and the Strand,

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.770
and they continue to occur 
at other locations.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:06.370
The extent of the damage is unknown.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:08.930
It can't be...

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.360
Reporting!

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:13.550
The rebel force is revolting! 
It's a coup d'état!

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.800
They've occupied St. Paul's Cathedral!

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.080
Say you prayers!

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:24.560
There was a traitor within the army?

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.570
Can we communicate with Twilight?

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:27.990
We can't connect!

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.320
So you've made your move, Finis...

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:36.120
Find the queen!

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.920
A coup d'état at a time like this?

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.140
I guess it's finally been put in motion.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.020
Isaac's plan, I mean.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.030
No doubt about it.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.380
I can see members of Twilight.

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.910
You're a deserter, aren't you?

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.250
N-No—

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.320
What's going on in the upper city?

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:28.480
Rebels have surrounded the palace!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:32.740
The queen is... London is done for!

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:37.450
You've gotta be kidding.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.640
This is worse than I imagined.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:51.400
Are the others...

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:53.390
Don't worry.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.430
Those guys won't be killed easily.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.410
But they're comrades in the same army...

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:08.440
I don't know what those 
Twilight guys are thinking,

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:10.380
but it's definitely nothing good.

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:14.890
We have to stop them.

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:19.030
Yeah, and for that to happen, 
there's one thing we have to do.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:24.990
The way to get rid of your poison,
 data on Code: Realize,

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:28.130
and all the other answers
 lie in St. Paul's Cathedral.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:32.290
But that's also the enemy's base.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.630
It won't be that easy to get in.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:38.090
That's why we have to get 
the British Army on our side.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:41.760
With them helping us, we can
 create an opportunity to strike.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:45.480
Get the British Army on our side? How?

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.750
Queen Victoria.

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:53.140
We have to save her before 
Twilight can capture her.

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:08.610
I don't have time to play around!

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:12.470
Lupin!

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:17.370
You all right?

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:18.410
Van!

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:20.740
What are you doing here?

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.340
Cardia!

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:24.250
Cardia!

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:27.150
Impey! Fran!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.250
Listen...

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.680
Thank goodness you're okay!

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.780
We've been so worried this whole time.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:42.640
Yeah! Oh, we have to let 
Saint know you're okay!

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:47.980
I'm sorry I worried everyone... I...

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.850
If you'll come back to us, it's all good!

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:54.930
You're our Cardia, after all!

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:56.780
Welcome back, Cardia.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.800
Yeah. I'm back.

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:08.440
This is a hell of a place 
for a touching reunion,

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:11.260
but your timing's perfect. Help us out.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.550
We want to save Victoria.

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:17.230
We were heading toward
 the palace to do just that.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:21.310
We can't lose her in
 a coup d'état like this.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:25.680
Some of her methods are hard to accept,

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:30.310
but she's given more of herself 
to this country than anyone.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:35.870
Well, then, Operation: Save the Queen
 is underway!

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.200
What happened?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:58.100
You can come out now, Guinevere.

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:04.140
It appears the monster has 
returned to her companions.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.310
Oh? That's good to hear.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.080
Code: Realize...

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:18.330
Isaac's ambition disturbs 
the history of mankind.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.320
Our organization, Idea,

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.150
the overseers of history, must correct it.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.290
I am to relay this gift to you.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.880
Use it wisely.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.700
She hasn't fallen into Finis's hands yet.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:37.580
Lupin and the others are acting 
on their own judgment

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:39.720
in an attempt to change fate.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:41.300
Can we not...

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.370
put our trust in them for a bit longer?

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.990
It's unlike you to say such things.

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:52.720
Is play-friendship so comfortable?

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:57.840
No one can change fate 
once it has been set.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:02.150
Idea merely upholds that 
and guides the people.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.390
Or so you believe.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:09.070
Have we anything else to believe?

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:15.500
Many thousands of people may die for 
compassion toward a single person.

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:20.240
I know you well understand 
the error in that.

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:24.250
<i>Yes... I do understand.</i>

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.520
<i>Or, I thought I did...</i>

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:33.720
<i>But the more time we spend together, 
the more comfortable I feel,</i>

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:37.120
<i>and the more my doubt grows.</i>

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:41.870
<i>What a truly unpleasant role 
I've been given.</i>

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.670
<i>Will this be your salvation,</i>

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.590
<i>Cardia?</i>

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.240
Where's the queen?!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:10.470
Find her!

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:15.640
Looks like Victoria is still here.

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:29.700
Cardia, you're not short 
of breath, are you?

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:31.580
No, I'm fine.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.680
Good. That's the result of your training.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.220
I am here.

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:43.960
Your Majesty!

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:45.940
I've grown tired of running...

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.220
Gotcha.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:55.830
Oh, dear!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.680
That vase was expensive, you know!

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:00.550
You sound just like her...

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.170
Right?

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:05.500
<i>Engaging the rebels outside the library!</i>

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:07.560
<i>Requesting immediate backup!</i>

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:15.100
This whole arrangement, from the revolt 
to the attack on the palace...

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.600
They may be the enemy, 
 but I'm still a bit impressed.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:21.580
It has cost us many soldiers.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.600
But you need to stay strong now.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:28.400
Your survival will ensure the 
future of the British Empire.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.500
Yes, I know.

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:34.510
Your Majesty, please stay back!

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.000
Leonhardt...

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.740
Whoa, that was too close, old man.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:51.490
Greetings to you, Queen Victoria.

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:54.890
The magnificent gentleman thief
 and his pupil

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:58.010
have come to take you with us.

00:12:58.010 --> 00:13:01.340
Arsène Lupin? Why are you...

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.250
I'm afraid I don't have time 
to explain in detail.

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:06.680
Cardia, how's it look on your end?

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.860
This hallway is clear.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:18.510
We have one goal:

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.290
to suppress the rebel forces.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.980
We can't afford to lose you.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:26.230
You have to trust me for now.

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:30.130
I have many questions...

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:34.910
But I believe it would be 
wisest to escape first.

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:37.300
So now that that's settled...

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:44.290
Crap! That's the signal!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.030
Sorry 'bout that!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:57.430
I'll hold them here. You guys go on!

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:58.270
Okay!

00:13:58.530 --> 00:13:59.230
Let's hurry!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.480
R-Right!

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.610
What is this passage?

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.340
It was used as an escape route long ago.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.690
It's no surprise you don't know about it.

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:10.650
And why do <i>you</i> know about it?

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:13.690
Well, we're just about to the exit.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:17.990
Is it rusted?

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:20.450
Well, it is pretty old.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:23.220
This might call for a bit of gunpowder...

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:26.000
No, let me handle it.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:26.950
Wait.

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:35.520
This is faster.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.380
Thanks.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:40.600
Is that the poison I've heard about?

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.590
So you are Cardia...

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.060
You look quite unlike
 you did last I saw you.

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:53.860
If we escape here alive, let's have 
a leisurely chat, my dear young lady.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.410
I'll remember that.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.850
It's so quiet.

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:07.510
We're pretty far from the palace now.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.890
Once we're across this, we'll be safe for—

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.150
Did you think it would be that easy?

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:20.010
I'm glad I got to see you on the day our 
plan was set in motion, my sister.

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:21.520
Finis...

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:29.030
Why are you here?!

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:34.540
You're not the only one who's 
good at outwitting people.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:39.880
Sister, did you like my gift to you?

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:45.300
So, tell me how it felt to 
learn what you really are.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:50.110
You are a real and true monster.

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:54.560
Not only do you have your poison, 
but you're not even human.

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:59.460
Were you shocked? Well? How did it feel?

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:03.930
I'm not a monster.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.400
Huh?

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:07.940
I am...

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:12.000
I am not a monster!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.130
Oh, of course.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:21.850
Because of those silly pieces of scum.

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:23.800
I don't like them.

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:27.960
What is Code: Realize? Why was I...

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.430
You don't know?

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:35.710
Code: Realize is the beautiful, 
perfect plan our father concocted...

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:41.350
to reduce not only England, but the 
whole world to nothing but ashes!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.040
The whole world?!

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.860
I won't let that happen!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:50.600
You won't let it? 
What are you talking about?

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:54.350
You're one of the ones meant 
to cause it, not stop it!

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:57.350
Let me tell you something interesting.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:01.400
When I, the vessel, and your Horologium

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:05.640
are brought together, 
the plan will be fully in motion.

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:09.020
We were created for no other purpose.

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:13.160
The coup d'état happening in 
London is barely the beginning.

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:17.380
There is far more to our father's 
Code: Realize than this.

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:21.120
You saw it on your way here, didn't you?

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:25.740
The destroyed cityscape, 
bodies lying everywhere...

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:31.280
We are going to bring even 
greater fear to the world!

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:39.020
Now, what is that? What can you accomplish
 by covering your eyes and ears?

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:45.480
Don't worry. Your own will 
has no bearing here!

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:50.130
Your very existence destroys 
everything around you, after all!

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:52.430
Shut up, Finis!

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:57.420
Do you get it? You are the one 
who'll destroy the world, Sister.

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:00.810
That is your fate.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:05.210
They'll all die because of you!

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:07.450
All of them... Everyone!

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:09.930
I told you to shut up!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.180
You're too loud.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.640
Lupin!

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:21.490
See? That's your fault, too!

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.170
Take my sister.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.390
We're here!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:40.880
Your knights have come for you, Cardia!

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:42.300
Impey?

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:44.140
They made it.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.340
Van!

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:53.940
Sorry.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.870
Old man Leon!

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.870
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.360
Everyone, hurry!

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:16.540
Go after them.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:19.770
My sister will destroy everything.

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:24.690
Everyone will die... because of her.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.830
<i>Mountains of rubble spilling 
all over the city...</i>

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:33.570
<i>Motionless bodies and flowing blood...</i>

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:39.410
<i>Is it my fate to bring about that fear?</i>

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:42.410
<i>If that is true,</i>

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:45.020
<i>then I...</i>

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:22.950
You're saying

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:28.960
this coup d'état broke out for
 the sake of Isaac Beckford's plan?

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:34.970
Yeah. We're heading to 
St. Paul's Cathedral to stop his plan.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.720
I request your help again.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:41.110
Please use the British Army to get rid 
of the rebel forces in the cathedral.

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:45.870
You make it sound so simple.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:47.760
However...

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:51.870
I have no reason to refuse.

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:55.010
Allowing them to take London

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:59.730
would mean the fall of 
the British Empire itself.

00:22:00.470 --> 00:22:04.130
So it sounds like we've 
formed a united front.

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:07.890
A royal and a gang of thieves 
sharing a united front?

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.400
How laughable.

00:22:10.810 --> 00:22:12.590
You can leave things to me.

00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:18.270
I'll make that little boy Finis 
regret raising his sword to me.

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:23.370
Cardia.

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:27.780
Saint? How did you know I was here?

00:22:28.170 --> 00:22:31.020
I know everything, of course.

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:37.950
You look very sad.

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:42.940
That's no surprise after you've learned 
so much in such a short time.

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:46.250
However, there's nothing to fear.

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:51.310
You won't be alone in heading 
toward where the truth awaits.

00:22:51.980 --> 00:22:56.090
You have many friends 
whom you can depend on,

00:22:56.400 --> 00:22:58.660
whom you can trust.

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:00.560
Saint?

00:23:01.050 --> 00:23:07.730
I... I'm sure that I truly 
love you and all the others.

00:23:08.420 --> 00:23:12.370
I want to see the answer that 
you find for yourselves.

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:17.530
To say "I'm sure" sounds 
rather silly, doesn't it?

00:23:18.740 --> 00:23:23.300
Imagine, not even knowing 
your own feelings...

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:27.600
I have a destiny to fulfill,

00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:29.820
as a disciple of Idea.

